	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Interim conveni legatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is ostendit literas, quae a capitaneo <placeName>Fleckenstein</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName>Lucernate</placeName>, <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> scriptae 22. septembris, in quibus hoc erat: nunciatum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l306">Mediolanum</placeName> <persName>Gorsiam</persName>, ammiralem <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName>, fudisse <placeName>Turcam</placeName> et ex omni insula <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>expulisse; <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanum</placeName> venisse cardinalem <persName>Borrhomaeum</persName>, factam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>processionem, <foreign xml:lang="de">ein krützgang</foreign> (sed non additur, quare)...</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Si <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vera haec sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><persName>Angusola</persName> in omni <placeName ref="l862">Helvetia</placeName> actutum sparget.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName>Bartholomaeus</persName> episcopus in communitatibus, quae in <placeName>Thuͦmläsch</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>magno cum applausu exceptus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Multa cum legato contuli <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>de his rebus; in eo convenit nobis: pestis <placeName ref="l2448">Quinquepagicos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>domi contineb<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>it.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Cu<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pit d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>le<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gatus ex te habere exemplar illius novi foederis <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l2448">Quinquepagici</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="regest">Bitte, die Bürgermeister von allem zu unterrichten.</note>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Es ist ein geschrey ußgangen, <placeName ref="l781">Ury</placeName> sye an 4 orten <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>einsmals anzündt, doch widerum gelöschet worden.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
